<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L1">连眼泪都未曾落下</text><text for="L2">不留一丝我们共度岁月的痕迹</text><text for="L3">就此告别了</text><text for="L4">独自迎来的清晨</text><text for="L5">传来某个人的声响</text><text for="L6">在那间我们共同生活过的房间里</text><text for="L7">闭着眼静静想着</text><text for="L8">到底是谁错了</text><text for="L9">我不知道</text><text for="L10">谁都没有错</text><text for="L11">大概吧</text><text for="L12">无论多少次 我们一定都会</text><text for="L13">是啊 无论多少年过去也一定都会</text><text for="L14">终究只会随着那句再见一同结束</text><text for="L15">想必也只能如此了</text><text for="L16">你回来啦</text><text for="L17">那句不经意脱口而出的话</text><text for="L18">不对啊</text><text for="L19">独自迎来的清晨</text><text for="L20">忽然想起某个人</text><text for="L21">两人共度的那些日子里</text><text for="L22">曾经理所当然的一切仍残留着</text><text for="L23">错的是你</text><text for="L24">是这样吗</text><text for="L25">错的是我</text><text for="L26">大概吧</text><text for="L27">这也不过是世间寻常的恋爱吧</text><text for="L28">这就是最后的答案了</text><text for="L29">我们就这样一点点错开了步调</text><text for="L30">这也不过是个随处可见又听惯了的故事</text><text for="L31">就连曾经那般闪耀的岁月</text><text for="L32">也会渐渐落满尘埃</text><text for="L33">无论多少次 我们一定都会</text><text for="L34">是啊 无论多少年过去也一定都会</text><text for="L35">走在那条通往告别的路上</text><text for="L36">想必也只能如此了</text><text for="L37">你回来啦</text><text for="L38">还是像往常一样</text><text for="L39">自然而然地脱口而出</text><text for="L40">彼此无法理解的事情</text><text for="L41">一定还有数不清的吧</text><text for="L42">毕竟我们不可能接纳彼此的一切</text><text for="L43">只是若连那些温柔相伴的日子</text><text for="L44">都已经变得令人难熬</text><text for="L45">就再也回不去了</text><text for="L46">无论多少次 我们一定都会</text><text for="L47">无论多少次 我们一定都会</text><text for="L48">是啊 无论多少年过去也一定都会</text><text for="L49">终究只会随着那句再见一同结束</text><text for="L50">想必也只能如此了</text><text for="L51">你回来啦</text><text for="L52">那句不经意脱口而出的话</text><text for="L53">不对啊</text><text for="L54">即便如此 无论多少次我一定都会</text><text for="L55">是啊 无论多少年过去也一定都会</text><text for="L56">想着若还能回到一切开始的时候</text><text for="L57">我终究还是会这样想</text><text for="L58">你回来啦</text><text for="L59">对着那句未能传达便悄然落下的话</text><text for="L60">我笑了</text><text for="L61">那是一个微凉的清晨</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:18.667"><div begin="2.308" end="18.745" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2.308" end="7.060" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2.308" end="2.905">涙</span><span begin="2.905" end="3.542">流</span><span begin="3.542" end="3.923">す</span><span begin="3.923" end="4.578">こと</span><span begin="4.578" end="5.220">すら</span><span begin="5.220" end="5.982">無いま</span><span begin="5.982" end="7.060">ま</span></p><p begin="7.507" end="16.003" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.507" end="8.469">過ごした</span><span begin="8.469" end="9.486">⽇々の</span><span begin="9.486" end="10.216">痕</span><span begin="10.216" end="11.012">⼀</span><span begin="11.012" end="11.796">つも</span><span begin="11.796" end="12.919">残さず</span><span begin="12.919" end="16.003">に</span></p><p begin="16.904" end="18.745" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.904" end="17.523">さよ</span><span begin="17.523" end="18.203">なら</span><span begin="18.203" end="18.745">だ</span></p></div><div begin="23.794" end="34.572" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="23.794" end="25.917" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.794" end="24.328">⼀⼈</span><span begin="24.328" end="24.562">で</span><span begin="24.562" end="25.172">迎えた</span><span begin="25.172" end="25.917">朝に</span></p><p begin="26.499" end="28.563" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.499" end="27.119">鳴り響</span><span begin="27.119" end="27.315">く</span><span begin="27.315" end="27.639">誰</span><span begin="27.639" end="27.987">かの</span><span begin="27.987" end="28.563">⾳</span></p><p begin="29.106" end="31.161" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.106" end="29.794">⼆⼈で</span><span begin="29.794" end="30.140">過ご</span><span begin="30.140" end="30.461">した</span><span begin="30.461" end="30.840">部屋</span><span begin="30.840" end="31.161">で</span></p><p begin="31.797" end="34.572" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.797" end="32.237">⽬を</span><span begin="32.237" end="32.994">閉じたまま</span><span begin="32.994" end="33.577">考</span><span begin="33.577" end="33.945">え</span><span begin="33.945" end="34.572">てた</span></p></div><div begin="34.582" end="44.341" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="34.582" end="37.374" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.582" end="35.543">悪い</span><span begin="35.543" end="36.273">のは</span><span begin="36.273" end="36.868">誰</span><span begin="36.868" end="37.374">だ</span></p><p begin="38.430" end="39.777" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.430" end="38.977">分かん</span><span begin="38.977" end="39.299">ない</span><span begin="39.299" end="39.777">よ</span></p><p begin="39.930" end="42.856" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.930" end="40.804">誰の</span><span begin="40.804" end="42.158">せいでも</span><span begin="42.158" end="42.856">ない</span></p><p begin="43.587" end="44.341" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.587" end="43.977">たぶ</span><span begin="43.977" end="44.341">ん</span></p></div><div begin="44.550" end="1:04.049" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="44.550" end="47.355" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.550" end="44.942">僕</span><span begin="44.942" end="45.309">らは</span><span begin="45.309" end="45.915">何回</span><span begin="45.915" end="46.540">だって</span><span begin="46.540" end="46.872">きっ</span><span begin="46.872" end="47.355">と</span></p><p begin="47.602" end="49.951" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.602" end="47.964">そう</span><span begin="47.964" end="48.579">何年</span><span begin="48.579" end="49.249">だって</span><span begin="49.249" end="49.538">きっ</span><span begin="49.538" end="49.951">と</span></p><p begin="50.258" end="55.538" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.258" end="51.870">さよならと</span><span begin="51.870" end="52.907">共に</span><span begin="52.907" end="54.597">終わるだけ</span><span begin="54.597" end="55.061">なん</span><span begin="55.061" end="55.538">だ</span></p><p begin="55.547" end="57.939" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.547" end="56.525">仕⽅が</span><span begin="56.525" end="57.261">ないよ</span><span begin="57.261" end="57.562">きっ</span><span begin="57.562" end="57.939">と</span></p><p begin="58.100" end="58.979" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.100" end="58.656">"おかえ</span><span begin="58.656" end="58.979">り"</span></p><p begin="59.059" end="1:02.707" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.059" end="59.589">思</span><span begin="59.589" end="1:00.306">わず</span><span begin="1:00.306" end="1:00.876">零</span><span begin="1:00.876" end="1:01.270">れ</span><span begin="1:01.270" end="1:01.789">た</span><span begin="1:01.789" end="1:02.248">⾔葉</span><span begin="1:02.248" end="1:02.707">は</span></p><p begin="1:03.103" end="1:04.049" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.103" end="1:03.503">違</span><span begin="1:03.503" end="1:03.658">う</span><span begin="1:03.658" end="1:04.049">な</span></p></div><div begin="1:14.390" end="1:25.242" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:14.390" end="1:16.536" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.390" end="1:15.134">⼀⼈で</span><span begin="1:15.134" end="1:15.866">迎えた</span><span begin="1:15.866" end="1:16.167">朝</span><span begin="1:16.167" end="1:16.536">に</span></p><p begin="1:17.102" end="1:19.180" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.102" end="1:17.583">ふと</span><span begin="1:17.583" end="1:17.956">想う</span><span begin="1:17.956" end="1:18.306">誰</span><span begin="1:18.306" end="1:18.837">かのこ</span><span begin="1:18.837" end="1:19.180">と</span></p><p begin="1:19.754" end="1:21.794" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.754" end="1:20.490">⼆⼈で</span><span begin="1:20.490" end="1:21.157">過ごした</span><span begin="1:21.157" end="1:21.471">⽇々</span><span begin="1:21.471" end="1:21.794">の</span></p><p begin="1:22.482" end="1:25.242" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.482" end="1:22.978">当たり</span><span begin="1:22.978" end="1:23.505">前が</span><span begin="1:23.505" end="1:23.889">まだ</span><span begin="1:23.889" end="1:24.496">残って</span><span begin="1:24.496" end="1:24.853">い</span><span begin="1:24.853" end="1:25.242">る</span></p></div><div begin="1:25.253" end="1:35.042" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:25.253" end="1:28.017" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.253" end="1:26.269">悪い</span><span begin="1:26.269" end="1:26.918">のは</span><span begin="1:26.918" end="1:27.570">君</span><span begin="1:27.570" end="1:28.017">だ</span></p><p begin="1:29.205" end="1:30.442" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.205" end="1:29.606">そう</span><span begin="1:29.606" end="1:29.902">だっ</span><span begin="1:29.902" end="1:30.442">け</span></p><p begin="1:30.595" end="1:33.339" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.595" end="1:31.511">悪い</span><span begin="1:31.511" end="1:32.204">のは</span><span begin="1:32.204" end="1:32.855">僕</span><span begin="1:32.855" end="1:33.339">だ</span></p><p begin="1:34.281" end="1:35.042" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.281" end="1:34.674">たぶ</span><span begin="1:34.674" end="1:35.042">ん</span></p></div><div begin="1:35.504" end="1:54.777" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:35.504" end="1:38.081" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.504" end="1:35.954">これも</span><span begin="1:35.954" end="1:36.878">⼤衆的</span><span begin="1:36.878" end="1:37.475">恋愛</span><span begin="1:37.475" end="1:37.775">で</span><span begin="1:37.775" end="1:38.081">しょ</span></p><p begin="1:38.092" end="1:40.747" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.092" end="1:38.678">それは</span><span begin="1:38.678" end="1:39.555">最終的</span><span begin="1:39.555" end="1:39.803">な</span><span begin="1:39.803" end="1:40.247">答え</span><span begin="1:40.247" end="1:40.747">だよ</span></p><p begin="1:40.756" end="1:43.400" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.756" end="1:41.350">僕ら</span><span begin="1:41.350" end="1:42.146">だんだんと</span><span begin="1:42.146" end="1:42.667">ズレて</span><span begin="1:42.667" end="1:42.933">いっ</span><span begin="1:42.933" end="1:43.400">たの</span></p><p begin="1:43.408" end="1:47.048" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.408" end="1:43.943">それも</span><span begin="1:43.943" end="1:44.448">ただ</span><span begin="1:44.448" end="1:45.199">よくある</span><span begin="1:45.199" end="1:46.003">聴き慣れた</span><span begin="1:46.003" end="1:46.631">ストーリー</span><span begin="1:46.631" end="1:47.048">だ</span></p><p begin="1:47.088" end="1:51.522" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.088" end="1:47.826">あんなに</span><span begin="1:47.826" end="1:48.647">輝</span><span begin="1:48.647" end="1:49.233">いてい</span><span begin="1:49.233" end="1:49.928">た</span><span begin="1:49.928" end="1:50.818">⽇々に</span><span begin="1:50.818" end="1:51.522">すら</span></p><p begin="1:51.533" end="1:54.777" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.533" end="1:52.560">埃</span><span begin="1:52.560" end="1:52.879">は</span><span begin="1:52.879" end="1:53.893">積もって</span><span begin="1:53.893" end="1:54.225">いくん</span><span begin="1:54.225" end="1:54.777">だ</span></p></div><div begin="1:55.902" end="2:18.752" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:55.902" end="1:59.277" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.902" end="1:56.550">僕</span><span begin="1:56.550" end="1:57.237">らは</span><span begin="1:57.237" end="1:57.897">何回</span><span begin="1:57.897" end="1:58.557">だって</span><span begin="1:58.557" end="1:58.895">きっ</span><span begin="1:58.895" end="1:59.277">と</span></p><p begin="1: